    "created_at": "2026-01-14T14:06:22Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-14T14:06:22Z",
    "body": "As an initial attempt at making progress I've made https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/12066, this does the initial refactoring to make this mixin (well technically a new one) work for SVG `<a>` too.\n\nOnce we have this HyperlinkElementUtils mixin we should be able to move more of the shared stuff to it. That way SVG, HTML and MathML can all share a definition.",
